			"Message": "docs(Sky): Normalize badge labels and fix download URL\n\nStandardize the README badge label text from plural forms (\"Last-commit\",\n\"Issues\", \"Downloads\") to singular (\"Update\", \"Issue\", \"Download\") for\nconsistent presentation across the Sky component README.\n\nAlso correct the GitHub download badge URL by appending \"/total\" to the\nshields.io endpoint, which was incorrectly omitting the total-downloads\nsuffix and would have shown stale or incorrect data.\n\nThis keeps the badge metadata aligned with the project's naming conventions\nand ensures accurate download count display.",
